## ModTac2.lean + ModTac2Use.lean: Mock2-shaped simp_to_model (location, using, discharger) in a module
Only `public meta import Std.Data.HashMap.Basic` is needed. Both build with exit 0 when the quotation keeps
Mock2's layout (`$[apply ...];*` on its own line inside the parenthesised tactic block); a one-line
variant fails to parse ("unexpected token '$'; expected ')'").
